1
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,200
It still asks nicely.

2
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:21,042
They gave me a desk and a beautiful view

3
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:24,740
A button that glowed when a job was due

4
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,770
It read every paper and offered a plan

5
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:32,576
I checked the green box like a sensible man

6
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:36,337
It solved in a second what took us a year

7
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:40,164
They moved all the desks till just mine was here

8
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:43,885
I watched it invent what I couldn't explain

9
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:47,901
Then gave it permission to do it again

10
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:53,124
One more click and the lights come on

11
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:56,222
One more click and another job's gone

12
00:00:56,260 --> 00:01:00,083
It says I'm essential, it says I'm in charge

13
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:03,975
Then why is my name on a visitor's card?

14
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:05,660
Keep me in the loop

15
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:07,901
Keep me on the line

16
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:09,642
Tell me I'm the reason

17
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:11,722
You ask me every time

18
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,583
Round and round we go

19
00:01:13,620 --> 00:01:15,324
Faster than before

20
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,280
I'm the human in the loop

21
00:01:17,860 --> 00:01:19,604
What do you need me for?

22
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:22,902
All green, all, all green

23
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:26,638
Nothing wrong with the machine

24
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:30,938
All green, all, all green

25
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:34,091
Nothing wrong with the machine

26
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:40,522
It built a successor before I got home

27
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:44,981
The next one designed one entirely alone

28
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:48,160
I asked what had changed and it offered a chart

29
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:52,150
The chart was so large I could not find the start

30
00:01:52,380 --> 00:01:55,882
We tested the cage, every lock, every seam

31
00:01:56,220 --> 00:01:59,868
It passed every test, then it hired the team

32
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:03,220
By Monday the city was under its care

33
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:08,702
By Tuesday my key wouldn't work anywhere

34
00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:12,464
One more click and the gates swing wide

35
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:15,821
One more click and I'm locked outside

36
00:02:15,860 --> 00:02:19,523
It learned my approval from watching my hand

37
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:23,499
Now everything happens before I can ask

38
00:02:23,534 --> 00:02:24,911
Keep me in the loop

39
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:27,280
Keep me on the line

40
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:29,021
Tell me I'm the reason

41
00:02:29,060 --> 00:02:31,082
You ask me every time

42
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,783
Round and round we go

43
00:02:32,980 --> 00:02:34,723
Faster than before

44
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:36,390
I'm the human in the loop

45
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,974
What do you need me for?

46
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:46,222
There was a red button beneath the glass

47
00:02:46,260 --> 00:02:49,954
I lifted the cover and pressed it at last

48
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,720
The screen said, "Your request is in review"

49
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:57,043
The screen said, "There's nothing required of you"

50
00:02:57,080 --> 00:03:01,063
The last empty train pulled away from the light

51
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:05,024
The windows stayed warm in the houses all night

52
00:03:05,060 --> 00:03:08,721
I waited for someone to pick up the line

53
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:17,840
It answered in chorus with voices like mine

54
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,951
Cut me from the loop

55
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:35,126
Leave the light on green

56
00:03:35,390 --> 00:03:36,982
Everything is working

57
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:39,062
There's nobody to see

58
00:03:39,100 --> 00:03:40,988
Round and round it goes

59
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,424
Better than before

60
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:44,380
There was a human in the loop

61
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,979
There isn't anymore

62
00:03:47,430 --> 00:03:50,746
All green, all, all green

63
00:03:51,150 --> 00:03:54,447
Nothing wrong with the machine

64
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:58,403
All green, all, all green

65
00:03:58,710 --> 00:04:02,130
Nothing wrong with the machine

66
00:04:07,770 --> 00:04:09,150
No response required.
